WEBVTT

00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:02.897
it will fundamentally change, I hope,

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.330
the way you think about the human past

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.963
and hopefully the present
and the future as well.

00:01:09.997 --> 00:01:14.530
Now, let's get started by asking
three basic questions

00:01:14.563 --> 00:01:17.097
about the contents of our reality,

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:20.797
the real world that you and I share
right here, right now.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.063
First of all:

00:01:23.363 --> 00:01:27.097
What is it that makes something real
in our real world?

00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:30.430
Well, for us, real things
are material things,